<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates close lower, seen falling.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates close lower, seen falling.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn</p>
<p>rates closed lower on Thursday on yarn users' low demand,</p>
<p>dealers said. Rates are likely to fall next week.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan</p>
<p>Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21</p>
<p>counts:			    Thursday    July 21</p>
<p>    Globe (Hina brand)	 440	   460</p>
<p>    MGM			    440	   450</p>
<p>    Gul Ahmed		    460	   475</p>
<p>($1 = 40.62 rupees) -- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
